%%{init: {'flowchart': {'curve': 'linear'}} }%%
flowchart TB
  S([Start]) --> A[Detect internet restored]
  A --> B[Load offline queue]
  B --> C{Queue empty?}
  C -->|Yes| D[Set status idle]
  C -->|No| E[Process queued operation]
  E --> F{Operation success?}
  F -->|Yes| G[Mark synced]
  F -->|No| H[Keep for retry]
  G --> I{More operations?}
  I -->|Yes| E
  I -->|No| J[Refresh local cache]
  H --> J
  J --> D
  D --> K([End])
